{% set spec = data("config/criteria.yaml") %}
{% set plan = data("evaluation/registration_plan.json") %}
# The criteria {{ spec.customer }} signed

These are the terms the whole month answers to, written as code in config/criteria.yaml and signed
on {{ spec.signed }}. They were hashed with the splits, the budgets and the Phase 1 plan at
{{ plan.registered_at }} (hash {{ plan.hash[:12] }}), before the lake existed and before any result
was computed. A change after the hash is a change request in DECISIONS.md with both verdicts.

{% set ns = namespace(ids=[]) %}
{% for c in spec.criteria %}
{% if c.phase is string or c.phase == 1 %}
{% set ns.ids = ns.ids + [c.id] %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
Each criterion names the phase that produces its evidence. Phase 1 produces the evidence for
{{ ns.ids | join(", ") }}, in part or in full; the others say which phase will.

{% for c in spec.criteria %}
## {{ c.id }}, {{ c.name | lower }}

{{ c.sentence }}

- Metric: {{ c.metric }}
- Population: {{ c.population }}
- Split: {{ c.split }}
- Interval: {{ c.interval }}
- Compared with: {{ c.comparator }}
- Evidence file: {{ c.evidence }}
- Phase that produces it: {{ c.phase }}
{% set verdict = "criteria." ~ c.id | lower ~ ".verdict" %}
{% if has(verdict) %}
- Verdict so far: {{ v(verdict) }}
{% endif %}

{% endfor %}
{{ statement() }}
